ui-1qm1lh">The world&#x27;s most experienced Anthropic brokers are here to advise you on buying and selling opportunities.</div><div class="MuiAvatarGroup-root mui-ic80fw"></div></div><div class="font-12 color-neutrals-gray-alt border-t-neutrals-stroke MuiBox-root mui-vrk4dv"><button type="button" class="btn-link btn-link--underline-hover btn-link--darken-hover">Contact Notice with questions about Anthropic</button></div></div></div><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1lh9y0x"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-0"><h2 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-1rumtha">Anthropic Market Activity<div class="MuiBox-root mui-997e60" id="market"></div></h2><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1pjoqq"><div class="color-neutrals-dark-alt font-16 MuiBox-root mui-0">Sign up to see Anthropic market activity and explore opportunities to invest.</div><div class="color-neutrals-dark-alt font-16 MuiBox-root mui-0">Express interest in open buy or sell indications or anonymously post your own buy or sell interest to the world&#x27;s best broker network.</div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-0"><a class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-containedSecondary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-containedSizeMedium MuiButton-colorSecondary MuiButton-disableElevation MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-containedSecondary MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-containedSizeMedium MuiButton-colorSecondary MuiButton-disableElevation mui-1f76h0o" tabindex="0" href="/signup">Sign up</a></div></div><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1f2qzn3"><div class="font-16 MuiBox-root mui-0"><div class="card MuiBox-root mui-1cuklpi"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1qm1lh"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-axw7ok"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-1wyzqfz"></div><div class="color-neutrals-gray MuiBox-root mui-0">Indirect transfers only</div></div></div><div class="color-neutrals-dark-alt MuiBox-root mui-0">Anthropic does not allow direct stock transfers. Investors can get indirect exposure via special purpose vehicles or forward purchase contracts.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiStack-root mui-6r2fzw"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1v8my8o"><h2 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h3 mui-updm30">About Anthropic, PBC</h2><div class="color-neutrals-dark-alt font-16 MuiBox-root mui-0"><div class="MuiBox-root mui-0" id="company-about" style="-webkit-line-clamp:6;overflow:hidden;display:-webkit-box;-moz-box-orient:vertical;-webkit-box-orient:vertical"><div class="markdown"><p class="color-neutrals-dark-alt">Anthropic develops large language models and related tools for general-purpose AI assistants. Its main product is Claude, which supports conversation, document analysis, summarization, and code generation via apps and an API. The company focuses on research and techniques intended to make AI systems more reliable and aligned with human intent.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiBox-root mui-0"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-container color-neutrals-dark-alt mui-1gilxu5"><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-item MuiGrid-grid-xs-6 MuiGrid-grid-md-4 mui-1gq9pgq"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1kkt86i"><div class="font-12 font-medium color-neutrals-gray MuiBox-root mui-0">Founded</div><div class="font-16 strong color-neutrals-dark MuiBox-root mui-0">2021</div></div></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-item MuiGrid-grid-xs-6 MuiGrid-grid-md-4 mui-1gq9pgq"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1kkt86i"><div class="font-12 font-medium color-neutrals-gray MuiBox-root mui-0">Employees</div><div class="font-16 strong color-neutrals-dark MuiBox-root mui-0">5,740</div></div></div><div class="MuiGrid-root MuiGrid-item MuiGrid-grid-xs-6 MuiGrid-grid-md-4 mui-1gq9pgq"><div class="MuiStack-root mui-1kkt86i"><div class="font-12 font-medium color-neutrals-gray MuiBox-root mui-0">Website</div><div class="font-16 strong color-neutrals-dark MuiBox-root mui-0"><a class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover font-medium font-16 nowrap mui-4txl93" href="htt